<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index down 31 points to 1,361.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index down 31 points to 1,361.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,361 today from 1,392 on April 16, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
